WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:17.625 --> 00:00:20.625
And together, we'll rule the world...

00:00:20.625 --> 00:00:22.458
from edge to edge.

00:00:22.541 --> 00:00:25.166
Thank you, Kyrie. I’ll be in touch.

00:00:30.375 --> 00:00:32.291
What’s ​he​ doing here?

00:00:32.291 --> 00:00:33.875
Oh, he was just...

00:00:33.875 --> 00:00:35.708
asking questions.

00:00:35.958 --> 00:00:37.500
What are ​you​ doing here?

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:38.750
I thought it was quite generous we

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:40.583
let you hang around for six battles.

00:00:40.583 --> 00:00:42.750
Now you’re just being greedy with my time.

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:46.208
Clearly my defense has yet to earn your respect.

00:00:46.208 --> 00:00:49.458
I respect your​ effort​...

00:00:49.458 --> 00:00:52.916
and I heard you said nice things about me after the battle.

00:00:52.916 --> 00:00:54.666
You’re a worthy opponent.

00:00:54.666 --> 00:00:57.000
If you like me as your opponent,

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.958
you’d love me as your teammate.

00:00:58.958 --> 00:01:01.958
Free-agent talk will wait until​ after ​the tournament.

00:01:02.333 --> 00:01:05.333
Oh, come on. Have a little fun...

00:01:05.333 --> 00:01:07.791
gods know you’re not having any here.

00:01:07.791 --> 00:01:11.166
If you want some scrub, go to an eliminated house.

00:01:11.166 --> 00:01:13.375
If you want a king...

00:01:13.375 --> 00:01:14.458
earn him.

00:01:17.375 --> 00:01:21.041
Wow, pure gold.

00:01:21.041 --> 00:01:23.791
It's funny. I thought your throne would be made of salt.

00:01:23.791 --> 00:01:27.291
You’re insolent. I’ve dropped 40 on men for less.

00:01:27.291 --> 00:01:29.000
They were lesser men.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:31.625
Oh, please. Didn’t I just drop 50 on you?

00:01:31.625 --> 00:01:34.166
We’re done here.

00:01:34.166 --> 00:01:35.708
Well then,

00:01:35.708 --> 00:01:38.708
I guess good luck in New York.

00:01:38.708 --> 00:01:40.875
Who says I'm going to New York?

00:01:40.875 --> 00:01:43.875
Oh...everybody.

00:01:44.708 --> 00:01:48.000
The Garden is the biggest stage in the Realm. 

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:51.000
I would be the GOAT if I turned that house around.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.458
And if you fail...on this

00:01:53.458 --> 00:01:55.833
“biggest stage in the Realm"?

00:01:56.208 --> 00:01:58.125
Wah! Can’t win with those cats.

00:01:58.125 --> 00:02:01.916
Listen to your burner. You can’t win with those cats.

00:02:01.916 --> 00:02:04.416
What you need is a dog.

00:02:04.416 --> 00:02:08.458
A hungry, loyal hound.

00:02:08.458 --> 00:02:11.500
You're proud to be a dog, eh? That’s a new one.

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:13.000
Men love dogs. 

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:16.250
What they loathe are snakes.

00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:19.250
If you’re trying to lure me to House Clippers,

00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:21.208
you’re doing an awful job.

00:02:21.208 --> 00:02:23.166
You know, now that I think about it,

00:02:23.166 --> 00:02:25.291
House Clippers would be a terrible fit.

00:02:25.291 --> 00:02:28.541
I mean, we all know you only take...

00:02:28.541 --> 00:02:30.208
the hardest road.

00:02:30.208 --> 00:02:33.833
And House Clippers would be…smooth sailing, really.

00:02:33.833 --> 00:02:36.833
You’ve got Lord West, builder of empires,

00:02:36.833 --> 00:02:41.333
two max slots, the best lord commander in the Realm

00:02:41.333 --> 00:02:48.666
and a bunch of hungry, loyal dogs just looking for their alpha.

00:02:48.708 --> 00:02:51.041
It’s almost too easy.

00:02:51.041 --> 00:02:52.875
And besides,

00:02:52.875 --> 00:02:55.458
if you came to Los Angeles, 

00:02:55.458 --> 00:02:59.166
It would be so unfair to King James.

00:02:59.166 --> 00:03:03.375
Upstaged night after night in his own city,

00:03:03.375 --> 00:03:07.250
by the man who was always second-best.

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:11.708
You know, for a free agent, you’re very loyal to House Clippers.

00:03:11.708 --> 00:03:13.916
Loyalty is what dogs do best.

00:03:14.333 --> 00:03:16.250
Hey, uh, KD?

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:18.500
It’s my turn to sit on the throne.

00:03:19.166 --> 00:03:20.083
I should be going.

00:03:20.083 --> 00:03:22.625
You’ve been very generous with your time.

00:03:23.416 --> 00:03:24.250
We should talk.

00:03:30.833 --> 00:03:32.125
Well, maybe if you didn't miss all those threes...

00:03:32.125 --> 00:03:33.958
We got jinxed by The Truth...

00:03:33.958 --> 00:03:34.791
He's a bloody monster!

00:03:34.791 --> 00:03:36.583
Who could've expected Fred VanVleet?

00:03:36.583 --> 00:03:39.083
Men, we gather today to celebrate

00:03:39.083 --> 00:03:41.125
For if the whispers are true,

00:03:41.125 --> 00:03:44.125
Ser Giannis will be anointed the Most Valuable Knight.

00:03:46.416 --> 00:03:49.416
Thank you, but how can I be deemed the ‘most valuable’

00:03:49.416 --> 00:03:52.416
when I couldn’t even get us to the Finals?

00:03:52.416 --> 00:03:55.416
King James used to crush House Raptors without breaking a sweat.

00:03:56.083 --> 00:04:00.625
They were a different house then. They didn’t have that...monster. 

00:04:00.625 --> 00:04:04.333
We should be proud. We won 60 battles this year.

00:04:04.333 --> 00:04:06.500
Yes, but it is all for nothing.

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:10.083
Our tournament is over. The offseason has come.

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:14.250
If the Maesters are right, Durant will be heading East,

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:18.458
which means it’s going to be hard for us to even make conference finals again.

00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:21.458
We should ride home. We should test the market.

00:04:22.583 --> 00:04:27.083
Maybe sign with House Pelicans again? Or House Bulls?

00:04:27.083 --> 00:04:29.250
I hear House Lakers needs talent.

00:04:30.291 --> 00:04:32.750
As a former knight of House Suns,

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:35.750
I know misery, and this is not it. 

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:40.333
Sure, we're defeated, but we are not without hope,

00:04:40.333 --> 00:04:45.791
for we have the honor of fighting alongside true greatness.

00:04:45.791 --> 00:04:48.750
Not just of skill, but of character.

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:51.750
The King of the North may rule the East for now, 

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:55.541
but I recognize only one true king. 

00:04:55.541 --> 00:04:58.916
And his name is long and full of letters.

00:04:58.916 --> 00:05:06.166
Giannis Antetokounmpo is my king from this day until his last day.

00:05:06.166 --> 00:05:09.166
And you know what? I DO want to be here.​

00:05:10.208 --> 00:05:14.458
Last year, I fought side by side with King James. 

00:05:14.458 --> 00:05:18.083
I didn’t think we’d find another GOAT in the East...

00:05:18.083 --> 00:05:20.083
not in my career.

00:05:20.083 --> 00:05:22.333
But I was wrong!

00:05:22.333 --> 00:05:28.458
Giannis is not only the Most Valuable Knight in the Realm. He is

00:05:28.458 --> 00:05:31.041
The King in the East!

00:05:31.041 --> 00:05:32.833
Assuming Kawhi leaves, of course! 

00:05:32.833 --> 00:05:36.916
I remember the days when Brandon Knight was our​ best ​knight...

00:05:36.916 --> 00:05:38.833
or maybe it was Ramon Sessions.

00:05:38.833 --> 00:05:45.125
As Giannis has grown, so has the dignity and respect of this house.

00:05:45.125 --> 00:05:47.250
We have not known hope like this

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:50.875
since the days of Ser Alcindor and the Big O...

00:05:50.875 --> 00:05:53.875
and it’s all thanks to Giannis.

00:05:53.875 --> 00:05:56.875
The King in the East!

00:05:57.166 --> 00:05:58.541
To next year!

00:05:58.541 --> 00:06:01.291
-The King in the East!
-To next season!

00:06:01.291 --> 00:06:02.416
-The King in the East!
-To the future!

00:06:02.416 --> 00:06:11.958
-The King in the East!
-The King in the East!
-The King in the East!

00:06:13.666 --> 00:06:16.666
Oh, how quickly they forget

00:06:16.666 --> 00:06:19.208
Nine years, I ruled the East.

00:06:19.208 --> 00:06:23.625
From 3-1 down, I slayed the Warriors

00:06:23.625 --> 00:06:27.791
From the brink of baldness, I have restored my hairline

00:06:27.791 --> 00:06:31.500
And from the ashes of a lost season...

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:33.583
I will return.

00:06:33.583 --> 00:06:34.708
Rested

00:06:34.708 --> 00:06:36.083
Reborn

00:06:36.083 --> 00:06:37.666
Re-groined

00:06:37.666 --> 00:06:39.500
To reclaim my throne

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:42.083
As the true king...

00:06:42.083 --> 00:06:44.583
Of...the...

00:06:44.583 --> 00:07:02.125
Sea!

00:07:02.125 --> 00:07:03.083
Jam!

00:07:03.083 --> 00:07:05.125
All right. Cut, cut! 

00:07:05.125 --> 00:07:07.583
JaVale, you dunked on the wrong basket

00:07:07.583 --> 00:07:09.583
And Melo, what are you doing in front of me?

00:07:09.583 --> 00:07:10.791
Why aren't you in the banana canoe?

00:07:10.791 --> 00:07:12.708
Because I'm a star, Lebron

00:07:12.708 --> 00:07:14.250
And stars should be in leading roles

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:15.125
All right, well, hold on—

00:07:15.125 --> 00:07:18.000
Matt Barnacle, stop strangling Derek with the fishing wire

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:21.000
Well, it says here in the script that I swam 95 miles to kick his ass

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.250
so I figured I'd—figured I'd do it.

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:24.375
Completely uncalled for!

00:07:24.375 --> 00:07:26.250
You'll never be Kobe, LeBron!

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:28.708
-Yeah, you ain't never gonna win an Oscar!
-Yeah!

00:07:28.708 --> 00:07:30.958
OK, can someone get those guys out of here?

00:07:30.958 --> 00:07:33.583
Also, where did Magic go? He was supposed to be here.

00:07:33.583 --> 00:07:34.333
Um, excuse me?

00:07:34.333 --> 00:07:36.750
Can I play Kevin of Durant in the Monstarfish? 

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:39.750
No, Brandon. You're—you're in the wave.

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:41.250
Ugh, I think we need to do a rewrite. 

00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:42.958
This is just not working. 

00:07:44.166 --> 00:07:45.333
What's up, fanlings?

00:07:45.333 --> 00:07:48.083
It's me, your favorite Game of Zones character, 

00:07:48.083 --> 00:07:49.708
the Joker!

00:07:49.708 --> 00:07:51.875
You may know me from such episodes as—

00:07:51.875 --> 00:07:52.541
Oh, that's right. 

00:07:52.541 --> 00:07:54.666
There are no episodes about House Nuggets

00:07:54.666 --> 00:07:56.458
so why would you want to subscribe?

00:07:56.458 --> 00:07:58.083
Don't subscribe. This show is dumb.

